---
layout: layout.njk
notice: true
closing:
  line: { text: Partner with us, href: /partners/ }
---
{#- A test's page (content file 5.4.0; since 25 October 2026 the reviewer's seven parts, 3.1). The sickle
    cell, thalassaemia and SMA pages select it with layout: test-page.njk and differ only in their front
    matter, which is the content file's copy, brackets and all: a "[CONFIRM: …]", "[TBC: …]" or
    "[PLACEHOLDER: …]" never renders (the sentence before it is kept; a row, item, question or source
    that is only a bracket is left out). Hide the explanation, never the proof: the condition and the
    kit's contents open on a click; what the test detects, the laboratory, the evidence and the action
    stay in view.

    layout.njk opens the page (h1, lead, proof, openingActions) and closes it with the closing band and
    the notice for individuals (notice: true, set here). This layout writes the sections between:

      condition  { paragraphs, source }            required. "About the condition", a disclosure
                                                   under the opening, on its ice white (#about)
      detects    { h2, lead, rows, subs, who }     required. #detects: rows [{ icon, title, body }];
                                                   subs [{ id, title, body }], the conditions the
                                                   test also reads, each with its anchor (#sickle-beta);
                                                   who, the list "Who it is for"
      gap        { h2, items, picture }            optional. #why-dna: the lines where today's
                                                   testing stops; a picture beside them
      lab        { h2, rows, kit, boxes }          required. #laboratory: rows [{ icon, title, body }];
                                                   kit { title, body, lists [{ title, items }] } in a
                                                   disclosure; boxes [{ name, alt, caption }]
      evidence   { rows, where, link }             required. #evidence: approvals, patents and the
                                                   science as rows; where, the states, in words
      questions  [{ q, a }]                        optional. #questions, beside the family's links
      family     [{ text, href, note }]            the rest of the family; Develop a test follows
      closing    { h2, body, solid: { text, condition } }   the solid button is the email asking
                                                   for the test; the line button is Partner with us
    The bands after the opening alternate paper and stone, the first paper; the close is sprout. -#}
{%- from "picture.njk" import picture with context %}
{%- from "links.njk" import pageLink %}
{%- from "faq.njk" import faq %}
{%- set boxSizes = "(min-width: 64rem) 18vw, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 46vw" %}
{%- set asideSizes = "(min-width: 64rem) 34vw, 92vw" %}

{#- The keys a test page cannot do without stop the build when they are missing. -#}
{%- set condition = condition | required("condition", page.inputPath) %}
{%- set detects = detects | required("detects", page.inputPath) %}
{%- set lab = lab | required("lab", page.inputPath) %}
{%- set evidence = evidence | required("evidence", page.inputPath) %}
{%- set closingH2 = closing.h2 | required("closing.h2", page.inputPath) %}
{%- set closingSolid = closing.solid | required("closing.solid", page.inputPath) %}

{#- Which bands this page has, so each knows its surface: paper first, then stone, in turn. -#}
{%- set order = ["detects"] %}
{%- if gap %}{% set order = order.concat(["why-dna"]) %}{% endif %}
{%- set order = order.concat(["laboratory", "evidence"]) %}
{%- set asked = (questions or []) | bracketless("a") %}
{%- if asked.length or (family and family.length) %}{% set order = order.concat(["questions"]) %}{% endif %}
{%- macro surface(id) %}{{ " bg-paper" if order.indexOf(id) % 2 == 0 else "" }}{% endmacro %}

{#- An icon-led row: the icon tile, the title, the words. -#}
{%- macro iconRows(rows, cls) -%}
<ul class="spec {{ cls }}">
  {%- for row in rows | bracketless("body") %}
  <li>
    <span class="icon-tile">{% icon row.icon or "circle-check-big" %}</span>
    <div>
      <h3>{{ row.title | unbracket }}</h3>
      <p>{{ row.body }}</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endmacro %}

  <!-- About the condition: for the family who searched for it, a click away -->
  <section id="about" class="section on-mist test-about" aria-label="About the condition">
    <div class="wrap">
      <details class="about-condition">
        <summary>{% icon "book-open" %}<span>About the condition</span>{% icon "chevron-down" %}</summary>
        <div class="about-condition-body">
          {%- for p in condition.paragraphs | bracketless | paragraphs %}
          <p>{{ p }}</p>
          {%- endfor %}
          {%- if condition.source | unbracket %}
          <p class="footnote source">{{ condition.source | unbracket }}</p>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What it detects -->
  <section id="detects" class="section{{ surface('detects') }}" aria-labelledby="detects-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
        <h2 id="detects-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-7">{{ detects.h2 | unbracket | safe }}</h2>
        {%- if detects.lead | unbracket %}
        <p class="lead lg:col-span-5">{{ detects.lead | unbracket }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="detects mt-12">
        {{ iconRows(detects.rows, "spec-cards") }}
        {%- set who = (detects.who or []) | bracketless %}
        {%- if who.length %}
        <aside class="who" aria-labelledby="who-h">
          <h3 id="who-h" class="audience-h">Who it is for</h3>
          <ul class="ticks mt-4">
            {%- for item in who %}
            <li>{% icon "circle-check-big" %}<p>{{ item }}</p></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ul>
        </aside>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      {%- set subs = (detects.subs or []) | bracketless("body") %}
      {%- if subs.length %}
      <ul class="subs mt-12">
        {%- for sub in subs %}
        <li id="{{ sub.id }}">
          <h3>{{ sub.title | unbracket }}</h3>
          <p>{{ sub.body }}</p>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- if gap %}
  <!-- Why a DNA test here: where today's testing stops -->
  <section id="why-dna" class="section{{ surface('why-dna') }}" aria-labelledby="why-dna-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-x-16 lg:items-start">
        <div class="{{ 'lg:col-span-7' if gap.picture else 'lg:col-span-12' }}">
          <h2 id="why-dna-h" class="h2">{{ gap.h2 | unbracket | safe }}</h2>
          <ol class="gaps mt-10{{ ' gaps-stack' if gap.picture }}">
            {%- for item in gap.items | bracketless %}
            <li><span class="flow-n">{{ loop.index }}</span><p>{{ item }}</p></li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>
        {%- if gap.picture %}
        <div class="aside-picture lg:col-span-5">{{ picture(gap.picture.name, gap.picture.alt, asideSizes) }}</div>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}

  <!-- In the laboratory, with the kit -->
  <section id="laboratory" class="section{{ surface('laboratory') }}" aria-labelledby="laboratory-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="laboratory-h" class="h2 max-w-[44rem]">{{ (lab.h2 or 'In the laboratory, <span class="h-mark">with the kit.</span>') | unbracket | safe }}</h2>
      <div class="lab mt-12{{ ' has-boxes' if lab.boxes and lab.boxes.length }}">
        <div>
          {{ iconRows(lab.rows, "spec-list") }}
          {%- if lab.kit %}
          <details class="kit-contents">
            <summary>{% icon "package" %}<span>{{ (lab.kit.title or "What comes in the kit") | unbracket }}</span>{% icon "chevron-down" %}</summary>
            <div class="kit-contents-body">
              {%- if lab.kit.body | unbracket %}
              <p>{{ lab.kit.body | unbracket }}</p>
              {%- endif %}
              <div class="kit">
                {%- for list in lab.kit.lists %}
                {%- set items = list.items | bracketless %}
                {%- if items.length %}
                <div>
                  {%- if list.title %}
                  <h3 class="kit-h">{{ list.title | unbracket }}</h3>
                  {%- endif %}
                  <ul class="lines">
                    {%- for item in items %}
                    <li>{{ item }}</li>
                    {%- endfor %}
                  </ul>
                </div>
                {%- endif %}
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </details>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
        {%- if lab.boxes and lab.boxes.length %}
        <ul class="boxes lab-boxes">
          {%- for b in lab.boxes %}
          <li>
            <figure>
              {{ picture(b.name, b.alt, boxSizes) }}
              <figcaption>{{ b.caption | unbracket }}</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Evidence, and where it is used -->
  <section id="evidence" class="section{{ surface('evidence') }}" aria-labelledby="evidence-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="evidence-h" class="h2 max-w-[44rem]">{{ (evidence.h2 or 'Evidence, <span class="h-mark">and where it is used.</span>') | unbracket | safe }}</h2>
      {{ iconRows(evidence.rows, "spec-cards spec-three mt-12") }}
      {%- if evidence.where | unbracket %}
      <div class="audience-foot mt-10">
        <p class="audience-where">{% icon "map-pin" %}<span>{{ evidence.where | unbracket }}</span></p>
        {%- if evidence.link %}
        <div class="audience-act">{{ pageLink(evidence.link.href, evidence.link.text | unbracket) }}</div>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- if order.indexOf("questions") != -1 %}
  <!-- Questions, beside the rest of the family -->
  <section id="questions" class="section{{ surface('questions') }}" aria-labelledby="questions-h">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 id="questions-h" class="h2">Questions <span class="h-mark">we are asked.</span></h2>
        <div class="family-box mt-8">
          <h3 class="audience-h">Also in this family</h3>
          <ul class="family-links family-of-test mt-4">
            {%- for member in family %}
            <li>
              {{ pageLink(member.href, member.text | unbracket) }}
              {%- if member.note | unbracket %}
              <p>{{ member.note | unbracket }}</p>
              {%- endif %}
            </li>
            {%- endfor %}
            <li>{{ pageLink("/solutions/#develop", "Develop a test with us") }}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        {%- if asked.length %}
        {{ faq(asked) }}
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}
{{ content | safe }}
